urn so so what's the  conversation then  you know what's the friction in the  conversation then at this moment  i think that what i'm seeing in  conversations on linkedin is  um questions about the vaccine we know a  lot about the vaccine we know the  vaccine protects you we want to know  more about what the vaccine does for the  community of people  in the office as you know it is  unresolved yet whether or not  research doesn't tell us whether you can  still pass covet even if you don't get  covid  um so i think that businesses are going  to need to wait to let some of that  be um further understood before they  bring people back on mass  and i think also what i'm seeing in  conversations on linkedin  is that um people by and large even  though they don't want their employees  to mandate this  they're really asking for their  employees to encourage this people are  not going to feel safe at least they're  telling us that on linkedin  until they feel like most of the people  in fact all of the people that they're  going to work with have gotten the  vaccine  jesse ample of linkedin thank you so  much for being with us this morning  thank you
 

